### ==================================================================
### Inventory Shortage Assistant Service — Manual Test Collection
### Service path: /inventory-shortage-assistant
### ==================================================================

@host = https://b6bbf2b9trial-dev-inventory-assistant-srv.cfapps.us10-001.hana.ondemand.com

### Common Test Variables
@material = TG21
@material2 = TG12
@plant = 1710
@storageLocation = 0001
@batch = BATCH001
@reservation = 0000000123
@deliveryDoc = 0080000123


### ==================================================================
### 1. ENTITY PROJECTIONS (Read-only OData)
### ==================================================================

### Reservations — all
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/Reservations


###
### Reservations — open only
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/Reservations?$filter=ReservationItemIsFinallyIssued eq false

###
### MaterialStocks — all
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/MaterialStocks

###
### MaterialStocks — filtered by material
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/MaterialStocks?$filter=Material eq '{{material}}'

###
### MaterialStocks — filtered by material and plant
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/MaterialStocks?$filter=Material eq '{{material}}' and Plant eq '{{plant}}'

###
### MaterialStocks — filtered by storage location
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/MaterialStocks?$filter=StorageLocation eq '{{storageLocation}}'

###
### SalesOrderItems — filtered by material
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/SalesOrderItems?$filter=Material eq '{{material2}}'

###
### SalesOrderItems — filtered by material and plant
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/SalesOrderItems?$filter=Material eq '{{material2}}' and ProductionPlant eq '{{plant}}'

###
### OutboundDeliveries — filtered by delivery document
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/OutboundDeliveries?$filter=DeliveryDocument eq '{{deliveryDoc}}'

###
### OutboundDeliveries — filtered by material
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/OutboundDeliveries?$filter=Material eq '{{material}}'

###
### SalesOrderAnalytics — filtered by product/plant/period
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/SalesOrderAnalytics?$filter=ProductID eq '{{material2}}' and Plant eq '{{plant}}' and Year eq '2025' and Month eq '01'


### ==================================================================
### 2. JOULE-FRIENDLY RESPONSE FUNCTIONS (Matching Screenshot)
### ==================================================================

### Get Materials Running Out (Default - Weekly)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getMaterialsRunningOut(plant='{{plant}}')

###
### Get Materials Running Out (Monthly)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getMaterialsRunningOut(plant='{{plant}}',period='month')

###
### Get Materials Running Out (Yearly)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getMaterialsRunningOut(plant='{{plant}}',period='year')

###
### Get Materials Running Out (All Plants)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getMaterialsRunningOut()


### ==================================================================
### 3. PERIODIC SHORTAGE REPORTS (Modified Date-Month-Year Format)
### ==================================================================

### Weekly Shortages Report
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getWeeklyShortagesReport(plant='{{plant}}')

###
### Weekly Shortages Report (Specific Week)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getWeeklyShortagesReport(plant='{{plant}}',week='2026-07-20')

###
### Monthly Shortages Report
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getMonthlyShortagesReport(plant='{{plant}}')

###
### Monthly Shortages Report (Specific Month)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getMonthlyShortagesReport(plant='{{plant}}',month='2026-07-01')

###
### Yearly Shortages Report
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getYearlyShortagesReport(plant='{{plant}}')

###
### Yearly Shortages Report (Specific Year)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getYearlyShortagesReport(plant='{{plant}}',year='2026-01-01')


### ==================================================================
### 4. CORE FUNCTIONS — Main Joule Skills
### ==================================================================

### Get Materials Running Out This Week (with plant)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getMaterialsRunningOutThisWeek(plant='{{plant}}')


###
### Get Materials Running Out This Week (all plants)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getMaterialsRunningOutThisWeek()

###
