GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getMaterialShortageDetail(material='{{material}}',plant='{{plant}}')

###
### Get Material Shortage Detail (without plant)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getMaterialShortageDetail(material='{{material}}')

###
