###
### Get Materials At Risk (MEDIUM severity)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getMaterialsAtRisk(severity='MEDIUM')

###
### Get Shortage Status (Quick Response)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getShortageStatus(material='{{material}}',plant='{{plant}}')

###
### Get Shortage Status (All plants)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getShortageStatus(material='{{material}}')

###
### Get Recommended Actions (by plant)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getRecommendedActions(plant='{{plant}}')

###
### Get Recommended Actions (All plants)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getRecommendedActions()

###
### Get Weekly Shortage Trend (4 weeks)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getWeeklyShortageTrend(material='{{material}}',plant='{{plant}}',weeks=4)

###
### Get Weekly Shortage Trend (8 weeks)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getWeeklyShortageTrend(material='{{material}}',plant='{{plant}}',weeks=8)

