### ==================================================================

### Get Stock Level (Full parameters)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getStockLevel(material='{{material}}',plant='{{plant}}',storageLocation='{{storageLocation}}',batch='{{batch}}')

###
### Get Stock Level (Material + Plant only)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getStockLevel(material='{{material}}',plant='{{plant}}')

###
### Get Stock Level (Material only)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getStockLevel(material='{{material}}')

###
### Get Open Reservations (with material and plant)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getOpenReservations(material='{{material}}',plant='{{plant}}')

###
### Get Open Reservations (material only)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getOpenReservations(material='{{material}}')

###
### Get Open Reservations (All open)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getOpenReservations()

###
### Get Sales Order Demand
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getSalesOrderDemand(material='{{material2}}',plant='{{plant}}')

###
### Get MRP Demand
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getMRPDemand(material='{{material}}',plant='{{plant}}',week='2026-07-20')

###
### Get MRP Demand (current week)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getMRPDemand(material='{{material}}',plant='{{plant}}')


### ==================================================================
### 6. JOULE ASSISTANT — Natural Language Queries
### ==================================================================

### Ask about materials running out
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/askInventoryShortageAssistant(plant='{{plant}}')?question='Which materials will run out this week?'

###
### Ask about monthly shortages
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/askInventoryShortageAssistant(plant='{{plant}}')?question='Show me monthly shortage report'

###
### Ask about yearly shortages
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/askInventoryShortageAssistant(plant='{{plant}}')?question='What is the yearly shortage summary?'

###
### Ask for detailed analysis
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/askInventoryShortageAssistant(material='{{material}}',plant='{{plant}}')?question='Give me detailed shortage analysis'

###
### Ask about stock level
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/askInventoryShortageAssistant(material='{{material}}',plant='{{plant}}')?question='What is the current stock level?'

###
### Ask about reservations
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/askInventoryShortageAssistant(material='{{material}}',plant='{{plant}}')?question='Show me open reservations'

###
### Ask about sales orders
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/askInventoryShortageAssistant(material='{{material2}}',plant='{{plant}}')?question='What is the sales order demand?'

###
### Ask for recommendations
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/askInventoryShortageAssistant(material='{{material}}',plant='{{plant}}')?question='What should I do about shortage?'

###
### Ask for trend/forecast
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/askInventoryShortageAssistant(material='{{material}}',plant='{{plant}}')?question='Show me the trend for next few weeks'

###
### Ask for status check
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/askInventoryShortageAssistant(material='{{material}}',plant='{{plant}}')?question='Check status'

###
### Ask about materials at risk
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/askInventoryShortageAssistant(plant='{{plant}}')?question='Which materials are at risk this week?'

###
### General question (fallback)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/askInventoryShortageAssistant(material='{{material}}',plant='{{plant}}')?question='Hello, can you help me with inventory?'


### ==================================================================
### 7. PREDICTIVE FUNCTIONS
### ==================================================================

### Predict Shortages (4 weeks ahead - default)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/predictShortages(plant='{{plant}}')

###
### Predict Shortages (8 weeks ahead)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/predictShortages(plant='{{plant}}',weeksAhead=8)

###
### Predict Shortages (12 weeks ahead - max)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/predictShortages(plant='{{plant}}',weeksAhead=12)

###
### Predict Shortages (All plants)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/predictShortages()


### ==================================================================
### 8. ACTIONS — State-Changing Operations (POST)
### ==================================================================

### Trigger Procurement
POST {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/triggerProcurement
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "material": "{{material}}",
  "plant": "{{plant}}",
  "quantity": 500,
  "requiredBy": "2026-08-15",
  "priority": "HIGH"
}

###
### Create Purchase Requisition
POST {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/createPurchaseRequisition
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "material": "{{material}}",
  "plant": "{{plant}}",
  "quantity": 190,
  "deliveryDate": "2026-08-20",
  "purchasingGroup": "PG01"
}

###
### Request Production Rescheduling
POST {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/requestProductionRescheduling
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "material": "{{material}}",
  "plant": "{{plant}}",
  "newDate": "2026-08-01",
  "reason": "Material shortage - procurement delayed"
}

###
### Suggest Alternate Sourcing
POST {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/suggestAlternateSourcing
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "material": "{{material}}",
  "plant": "{{plant}}",
  "quantity": 300
}


