### ==================================================================
### 10. ERROR HANDLING TESTS
### ==================================================================

### Invalid plant (should return empty or graceful error)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getShortageStatus(material='{{material}}',plant='INVALID_PLANT')

###
### Empty question for assistant
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/askInventoryShortageAssistant(material='{{material}}',plant='{{plant}}')

###
### Very large weeks parameter (should cap at 12)
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getWeeklyShortageTrend(material='{{material}}',plant='{{plant}}',weeks=100)

###
### Invalid severity value
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getMaterialsAtRisk(severity='INVALID_SEVERITY')


### ==================================================================
### 11. PERFORMANCE & QUICK CHECKS
### ==================================================================

### Quick status for all critical materials
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getMaterialsAtRisk(severity='CRITICAL')

###
### Quick recommendation summary
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getRecommendedActions(plant='{{plant}}')

###
### Quick stock check for specific material
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getStockLevel(material='{{material}}',plant='{{plant}}')

###
### Quick shortage status for material
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getShortageStatus(material='{{material}}',plant='{{plant}}')

###
### Quick materials running out this week
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getMaterialsRunningOutThisWeek(plant='{{plant}}')



### ==================================================================
### 13. END-TO-END SCENARIO TESTS
### ==================================================================

### Complete shortage analysis workflow - Step 1: Check if material is at risk
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getShortageStatus(material='{{material}}',plant='{{plant}}')

###
### Complete shortage analysis workflow - Step 2: Get detailed analysis
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getMaterialShortageDetail(material='{{material}}',plant='{{plant}}')

###
### Complete shortage analysis workflow - Step 3: Get recommendation
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getRecommendedActions(plant='{{plant}}')

###
### Complete shortage analysis workflow - Step 4: Trigger procurement if needed
POST {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/triggerProcurement
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "material": "{{material}}",
  "plant": "{{plant}}",
  "quantity": 500,
  "requiredBy": "2026-08-15",
  "priority": "HIGH"
}

###
### Weekly review scenario - Step 1: Get materials running out this week
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getMaterialsRunningOutThisWeek(plant='{{plant}}')

###
### Weekly review scenario - Step 2: Predict future shortages
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/predictShortages(plant='{{plant}}',weeksAhead=4)

###
### Weekly review scenario - Step 3: Get trend analysis for critical material
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getWeeklyShortageTrend(material='{{material}}',plant='{{plant}}',weeks=4)

###
### Joule demo scenario - Step 1: Get simplified running out response
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getMaterialsRunningOut(plant='{{plant}}')

###
### Joule demo scenario - Step 2: Get weekly report with DD-MM-YYYY format
GET {{host}}/inventory-shortage-assistant/getThisWeekShortages()

